    "created_at": "2021-07-23T16:18:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-23T16:18:44Z",
    "body": "Only go in parallel for the steps that actually receive bytes from the network, since those are the only steps that need to block on some external action. Then immediately queue a task back to the main thread after you're done getting those bytes.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
